<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Room for Australia bank margins fall-Costello.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Room for Australia bank margins fall-Costello.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasurer Peter Costello said on Monday he believed there was more room for bank margins to fall.</p>
<p>&quot;In relation to margins, that is the margin for banks between the interest paid to depositors and the interest rate charged to borrowers, they have traditionally in Australia been high and there are opportunities for those margins to still fall further,&quot; he told parliament.</p>
</text>
